{"id":"985351114b7734a0","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-program-index.md","title":"Codes of Basic Machine Programs","display":"df-program-index — Codes of Basic Machine Programs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-program-index","aliases":["68-df-program-index"],"display":"df-program-index — Codes of Basic Machine Programs","depends_on":["[[68-df-sequence-code]]","[[68-df-basic-machine]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§8 pp.20-21 / PDF 29-30","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-program-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-program-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-program-index — Codes of Basic Machine Programs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8 pp.20-21 / PDF 29-30"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc}\">\\(\\operatorname{sc}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sd}\">\\(\\operatorname{sd}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a>。有限指令元组按其分量次序视为有限自然数序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span> 是空程序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pc}\">\\(\\operatorname{pc}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>，值域包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pc}(P):=\\operatorname{sc}\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{sc}(P(q)):q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\rangle\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Prog}:=\\{\\operatorname{pc}(P):P\\in\\mathcal P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pc}(P):=\\operatorname{sc}\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{sc}(P(q)):q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\rangle\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Prog}:=\\{\\operatorname{pc}(P):P\\in\\mathcal P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_e:=\\begin{cases}P&amp;e=\\operatorname{pc}(P),\\ P\\in\\mathcal P,\\\\()&amp;e\\notin\\mathrm{Prog}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_e:=\\begin{cases}P&amp;e=\\operatorname{pc}(P),\\ P\\in\\mathcal P,\\\\()&amp;e\\notin\\mathrm{Prog}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §8，印刷 pp.20–21 / PDF pp.29–30：INCREASE 编为 sc(0,i)，DECREASE 编为 sc(1,i,n)，GO TO 编为 sc(2,n)，程序再编码为指令编码的序列。sc 的单射性逐层保证程序解码唯一。非法 e 的默认空程序仅为全化记号；其计算必须额外要求 e∈Prog，不能把非法索引误当成计算零函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\mathcal I$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]；$\\operatorname{sc}$、$\\operatorname{sd}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。有限指令元组按其分量次序视为有限自然数序列。$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$P\\in\\mathcal P$；$()$ 是空程序。$\\operatorname{pc}$ 的定义域为 $\\mathcal P$，值域包含于 $\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\mathcal I$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]；$\\operatorname{sc}$、$\\operatorname{sd}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。有限指令元组按其分量次序视为有限自然数序列。$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$P\\in\\mathcal P$；$()$ 是空程序。$\\operatorname{pc}$ 的定义域为 $\\mathcal P$，值域包含于 $\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":